    "summary": "Seer Council errata giving **Unshrouded Truth** a new Target and Effect.\n\nTarget: an **ASURYANI INFANTRY** unit of yours (not **WRAITH CONSTRUCT**) within 9\" of a friendly **ASURYANI PSYKER** model, that so far this phase has not been picked to move and was not placed on the battlefield. Effect:\n\n- Move it into **Strategic Reserves**.\n- It gains **[Deep Strike](vsdata:core-ability/deep-strike)**.\n- It has to arrive with an **[ingress move](vsdata:core-rule/ingress-move)** during this phase.\n\nWhether that move is allowed in your first turn is not stated.",
